00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:18.099
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:22.440
Part one: words. You will learn twelve new words.

6
00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:24.366
Ingredient.

