13
00:00:45.217 --> 00:00:47.541
My grandmother's recipe is a secret!

14
00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.814
Your turn. Say: Recipe.

15
00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:54.633
Recipe.

16
00:00:55.383 --> 00:00:56.280
Marinate.

17
00:00:57.283 --> 00:01:00.421
