18
00:01:01.017 --> 00:01:02.970
Marinate the beef for one hour.

19
00:01:03.583 --> 00:01:06.166
Your turn. Say: Marinate.

20
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.966
Marinate.

21
00:01:10.717 --> 00:01:11.996
Portion size.

22
00:01:12.983 --> 00:01:16.202
Portion size means how much food one person eats.

23
00:01:16.817 --> 00:01:18.828
