28
00:01:34.017 --> 00:01:37.467
Rice is full of one macronutrient: carbs.

29
00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:41.119
Your turn. Say: Macronutrient.

30
00:01:43.967 --> 00:01:45.084
Macronutrient.

31
00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:47.153
Balanced diet.

32
00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:51.520
Balanced diet means eating the right mix of healthy foods.

33
00:01:52.117 --> 00:01:55.080
A balanced diet includes vegetables.

34
00:01:55.683 --> 00:01:58.603
Your turn. Say: Balanced diet.

35
00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:02.700
Balanced diet.

36
00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.439
Meal prep.

37
00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:08.018
Meal prep means preparing meals in advance.

38
00:02:08.617 --> 00:02:10.976
Meal prep saves time on busy days.

39
00:02:11.583 --> 00:02:14.305
Your turn. Say: Meal prep.

40
00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:18.261
Meal prep.

41
00:02:19.017 --> 00:02:19.844
