43
00:02:24.617 --> 00:02:26.372
Garnish the soup with basil.

44
00:02:26.983 --> 00:02:29.194
Your turn. Say: Garnish.

45
00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:32.872
Garnish.

46
00:02:33.617 --> 00:02:34.362
