49
00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:44.319
Your turn. Say: Simmer.

50
00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.040
Simmer.

51
00:02:48.783 --> 00:02:50.063
Substitute.

52
00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:53.851
Substitute means to use one thing instead of another.

53
