54
00:02:57.317 --> 00:03:00.004
Your turn. Say: Substitute.

55
00:03:02.867 --> 00:03:04.216
Substitute.

56
00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:05.719
Wholesome.

57
00:03:06.717 --> 00:03:08.983
Wholesome means healthy and good for you.

58
00:03:09.583 --> 00:03:11.502
Fruit is a wholesome snack.

59
00:03:12.117 --> 00:03:14.792
Your turn. Say: Wholesome.

60
00:03:17.633 --> 00:03:18.483
Wholesome.

61
00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.147
Flavorful.

62
00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.125
Flavorful means with a strong, delicious taste.

63
00:03:24.717 --> 00:03:26.960
